  "meta": {
    "title": "Dossier, capabilities showcase",
    "slug": "showcase",
    "kicker": "Live demo",
    "lede": "Everything below, navigation, search, theme, code, diagrams, charts, math, citations, and an interactive review board, lives in one self-contained HTML file with no external assets. The page is a projection of the JSON your AI wrote [@dossier-readme].",
    "updated": "2026-06-29",
    "status": "durable"
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "parts": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "markdown": "**One JSON file becomes this**"
        },
        {
          "type": "spec",
          "spec": [
            {
              "label": "Highlights",
              "text": "43 block types · Self-contained · Agent-readable · Light + dark"
            },
            {
              "label": "Source",
              "text": "one .dossier.json"
            },
            {
              "label": "Output",
              "text": "one .html"
            },
            {
              "label": "Runtime deps",
              "text": "0"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "spec",
          "spec": [
            {
              "label": "Owner",
              "text": "Kyle"
            },
            {
              "label": "Tags",
              "text": "demo, blocks"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "title": "Use the full-page toolbar.",
          "tone": "note",
          "markdown": "In the full HTML artifact, **Edit** changes text in place, the color swatch restyles live in the **Theme Studio**, and **Export** gives you Markdown, JSON, or the agent digest. From the CLI, `dossier export` also writes **Word** (charts and diagrams embedded as images) or **PDF**."
        },
        {
          "type": "spec",
          "spec": [
            {
              "label": "Block types",
              "text": "43 (+1 citation block)"
            },
            {
              "label": "Runtime deps",
              "text": "0 (view-time network free)"
            },
            {
              "label": "Renderers (Node + React)",
              "text": "2 (same model)"
            },
            {
              "label": "Self-contained",
              "text": "100% (HTML + source)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "spec",
          "spec": [
            {
              "label": "For humans",
              "text": "A navigable, searchable, themeable page, not a wall of Markdown."
            },
            {
              "label": "For agents",
              "text": "The full model is embedded as `#dossier-model`; read one block, no scraping."
            },
            {
              "label": "For your wiki",
              "text": "One portable file, link it, email it, or `<iframe>` it anywhere."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "structure-prose",
      "title": "Structure & prose",
      "parts": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "markdown": "Sections nest other blocks; text fields take inline markdown."
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "markdown": "This is a **prose** block with `inline code`, a [link](https://github.com/kylebegeman/dossier), and a footnote.[^island]\n\n- Bullet lists render as real lists.\n- Inline markdown still works inside list items.\n\n1. Numbered lists work too.\n2. Paragraph rhythm stays intact.\n\nA second paragraph to show vertical rhythm."
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "markdown": "### How it's built"
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "markdown": "1. **Author** An agent writes a `*.dossier.json`.\n2. **Validate** `dossier build` validates and lints.\n3. **Render** JSON becomes HTML + the data island + Markdown.\n4. **Use** Read, decide, export, embed."
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "markdown": "### Roadmap"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "columns": [
            "Phase",
            "Status",
            "Notes"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "0.1",
              "done",
              "Generator, catalog, features."
            ],
            [
              "0.2",
              "done",
              "MCP, plugins, new blocks."
            ],
            [
              "0.5",
              "done",
              "Process workflows, publishing, embed output, and live editor hooks."
            ],
            [
              "0.6",
              "done",
              "Repo packs, workspaces, release evidence, state packets, citations, and package-manager distribution."
            ],
            [
              "0.7",
              "planned",
              "Leaner reader shell, one export contract, fewer block families, and a new default theme."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "title": "Composable.",
          "tone": "note",
          "markdown": "Sections, two-col, and tabs nest other blocks."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "title": "Self-contained.",
          "tone": "risk",
          "markdown": "No external fonts, scripts, or images. Works offline."
        }
      ]
    },
